Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.46,0:08:46.84,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fs35\frz12.08\fax0.05\c&H707091&\move(543,361,472,196,24,2359)}明天早上再聯絡你\N抱歉！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.46,0:08:46.84,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fs35\frz11.7\fax0.05\c&H707091&\move(1045,267,974,102,24,2359)}保重身體
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.46,0:08:46.84,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fs35\frz12.08\fax0.05\c&HFFF7EF&\move(866,456,795,291,24,2359)}今天
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.46,0:08:46.84,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fs35\frz12.08\fax0.1\c&H707091&\move(1079,480,1008,315,24,2359)}果然發燒了\N你先走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.46,0:08:46.84,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fs35\frz12.08\fax0.1\c&H707091&\move(1112,594,1041,429,24,2359)}你一個人沒問題吧？\N回家路上也要當心喔
